THE FIVE LISTS ARE READ AND NOT RETYPED, and the pool - the frequency table, the term order and which terms stand at each threshold - is COMPUTED from them at build time. Nothing in the script or in this file is a transcription of a value list.

    const CAPSULE := preload("res://commons/primitives/capsule/capsule.gd")
    const DOME := preload("res://commons/primitives/booleans/dome.gd")
    const PLATONIC := preload("res://commons/primitives/platonic_grabbables.gd")
    const SPHERE_MID := preload("res://commons/primitives/godotmeshes/sphere_mid.gd")

read as CAPSULE.FACTURES / DOME.FACTURES / PLATONIC.FACTURES / SPHERE_MID.RESOLUTION - directly, not through Object.get() (a const is not a property, so get() returns null and the bench would fall back silently to its own copy) and not through get_script_constant_map() (non-static, cannot be called on the class). A direct read also fails at PARSE time if a const disappears, which is a better failure mode than either.

TWO MEMBERS ARE READ AS SOURCE TEXT INSTEAD, AND THAT IS A DECISION WITH A REASON. folded_strip.gd and triangleprofiles.gd both declare `var drag_points: DragPointSet`. DragPointSet is a global class whose own const preloads grab_sphere_point_with_text.tscn, which ext-resources res://addons/godot-xr-tools/objects/pickable.tscn. `/addons/*` is gitignored in this repo - godot-xr-tools is NOT tracked - so preloading either member would put a bench that needs no XR downstream of code that is not in the repository, which is how this corpus already lost one promotion. _factures_from_source() therefore opens the two files with FileAccess and pulls their `const FACTURES` line out with a RegEx. It is still derived from the code, it still push_errors loudly if the const is renamed or the file moves, and it drags nothing in.

_check_family_pool() runs at _ready and push_errors in BOTH directions: a term this bench draws that no member declares (an invented word), a term declared by two or more members that has no station (a silent hole in the exhibit), a member whose list came back empty, a MEMBER_COUNT that no longer matches the number of lists read, and - for the borrowed second axis - any mismatch either way between the @export_enum hint on `resolution` and sphere_mid.RESOLUTION's own keys.

THE STATION ORDER IS DERIVED, and the derivation is load-bearing. Terms sort by frequency descending, ties broken by first appearance in the member scan order (capsule, dome, folded_strip, platonic_grabbables, triangleprofiles - token alphabetical). `section` and `shell` both score 2; section is first seen in capsule at index 0 and shell in folded_strip at index 2, so section takes pad 4 and shell pad 5. The row therefore reads left to right as the pool's own frequency ladder, and quorum empties it from the right.

FOUR SINGLE-MEMBER TERMS ARE NOT STOOD, and the floor of `quorum` is two rather than one for that reason. `wear` (capsule), `blank` and `core` (dome) and `plate` (platonic) are each declared by exactly one artifact. A term one object uses is that object's own word, not a shared vocabulary, and standing it on a bench about what the family shares would be this artifact asserting a commons that does not exist. quorum runs over every threshold at which sharing is even defined - two, three, four, five.

THREE CONSTANTS ARE TRANSCRIBED, ON THE RECORD, because they are literals inside function bodies rather than consts and cannot be read off a class: capsule.gd::_facet's band tone 0.72, capsule.gd::_section's cut lightening 0.42, capsule.gd::_armature's wire lightening 0.35, and folded_strip.gd::_prism's rim darkening 0.42. Each carries its citation in the script. capsule.gd::WIRE_RADIUS and capsule.gd::FALLBACK_ALBEDO ARE consts and are read.

ONE DEPARTURE FROM A FAMILY IMPLEMENTATION, stated rather than hidden. capsule.gd::_facet tones on `face % 2` over the triangle sequence; on a strip-ordered lathe that darkens half of each quad rather than the quad, so what it draws is a zigzag inside every cell and not the bands its own doc block promises ("the five segments and five rings become things you can point at"). At 32 sides that zigzag is 3 px of alternating tone and reads as noise. This bench checkers by QUAD, on (row + column) parity, which is what capsule's prose describes. The tone itself is capsule's.

WHAT THE FIVE ORDERS COST UNDER TRIMMING, since build_dna_gallery trims from the tail: nothing, because `facture` is not swept here. It is recorded anyway for whoever tries. The five declaration orders are five different default hoists, so a capped single-axis `facture` sweep at cap 3 measures capsule on {cast, facet, armature}, dome on {cast, blank, core}, folded_strip and triangleprofiles on {facet, cast, armature} and platonic on {plate, cast, armature} - three DIFFERENT sets, sharing only `cast` pairwise in two cases and {cast, armature} in three. At no cap above 1 does this family compare like with like.
